Factur-X / ZUGFeRD EXTENDED schema

The four .xsd files in this folder are the XML schema of the EXTENDED profile
of Factur-X 1.09.2 / ZUGFeRD 2.5.2, one specification that FeRD (Forum
elektronische Rechnung Deutschland) and FNFE-MPE publish together. They come
from FeRD's ZUGFeRD 2.5.2 package, folder Schema/4_Factur-X_1.09.2_EXTENDED/,
unmodified, under FeRD's own file names.

FeRD's disclaimer and rights of use put the technical artifacts of the
specification, its schemas and Schematron, under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, whose text is in LICENSE beside this file:
https://www.ferd-net.de/en/ueber-uns/ressourcen-1/veroeffentlichungen/disclaimer-and-rights-of-use-zugferd

The Lpdf engine's build reads them to learn which element of a Cross Industry
Invoice may sit inside which, and which attributes it has.
